    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Global Properties is delighted to present this well maintained, modern three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached home, ideally located in the luxurious Water Rock Manor estate. Finished to a high standard and presented in excellent condition throughout, this home offers bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation. This property is ideally suited to growing families or those seeking a turnkey home in a welcoming and highly desirable area with convenient access to local amenities, schools and transport links.\r\n\r\nMidleton is a charming town known for its rich history, beautiful surroundings, and friendly community. The town has a lively atmosphere, with shops, cafés, restaurants, and local events throughout the year. With its mix of history, culture, and natural beauty, Midleton is an excellent place to live."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\nThe modern PVC front door opens to a bright hallway, Herringbone flooring, and gives access to the kitchen, living room and downstairs W.C.\r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining Area - 6.18m x 4.45m\r\nThis spacious fully fitted kitchen boasts a large selection of wall and floor units with a large island boasting a beautiful quartz countertop. There is also access to the back garden through the large sliding patio door. Herringbone flooring, window shutters.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.65m x 3.98m\r\nLarge living room with a bespoke media wall and full length windows providing excellent natural lighting. Herringbone flooring, window shutters.\r\n\r\nUtility - 2.28m x 1.6m\r\nPlumbed for washing/dryer, storage units, sink.\r\n\r\nDownstairs W.C - 1.6m x 1.49m\r\nW.C, W.H.B, herringbone flooring.\r\n\r\nCarpeted stairs to the first floor\r\n\r\nPrimary Bedroom - 4.58m x 4.1m\r\nLarge double room with en-suite, built in wardrobe, timber flooring, window shutters.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - 3.09m x 2.12m\r\nW.C, W.H.B, Shower & tiled thoughout.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.08m x 3.3m\r\nDouble room, built in wardrobe, timber flooring, window shutters.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.08m x 2.92m\r\nDouble room, timber flooring, window shutters.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nW.C, W.H.B, shower/bath, timber flooring.\r\n\r\nFront Garden\r\nTwo parking spaces, electric car charger.\r\n\r\nBack Garden\r\nLarge back garden with laid lawn and timber fencing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "124 sq mt/ 1,335 sq ft\r\nAir to Water Heating System\r\nExcellent Condition\r\nHigh Ceilings\r\nFull Length heritage style windows with shutters\r\nGeorgian inspired Architecture \r\nHerring bone flooring with underfloor heating\r\nQuartz Countertops\r\nElectric Car Charger\r\nSecurity Alarm & Cameras"
      },
      {
